{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.094, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.37 p=0.0261 n=25.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-014"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-068", "score": 0.093, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-068 | Study family SF-PAP-068: Opponent three-point luck has no persistent player component\n- observed_research_question: Opponent three-point luck has no persistent player component\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Opponent three-point luck is noise: split-half reliability ~0 and H1 does not predict H2.\n- observed_result: odd/even reliability: opp 3s 0.004; opp 2s 0.463; XNET 0.585; own luck 0.477; teammate luck 0.427; PM 0.549; H1 opp3 -> H2 opp3 per 100: +0.008 (SE 0.009); H1 opp2 -> H2: +0.009 (SE 0.009)\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:low_measurement_reliability\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MEASURE_RELIABILITY\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: reliability 0.004; H1->H2 +0.008 SE 0.009\n- observed_sample_and_power: 1,405 player-seasons; N=84,641 player-games\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF36\n- observed_verdict: supported"}, {"id": "FAM:SF40", "score": 0.088, "document": "# FAM:SF40 | Study family SF40: Player and teammate sequential premiums\n- observed_research_question: Player and teammate sequential premiums\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific same-player and teammate X->Y sequences carry PPP premiums above Y's baseline.\n- observed_result: [APPA-053] Top same-player: P. George DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.560 n=31 t=+2.2; J. Brown +0.349 n=62; L. Doncic DRIVE->PNR +0.309 n=53. Top teammate: K. Towns->O. Anunoby DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.398 n=30; J. Brown->J. Tatum DRIVE->PN [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- observed_result: [APPS-038] Top: P. George DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.560 (n=31, t=+2.2). D. Mitchell SPOT_UP->DRIVE +0.279 (n=56, t=+2.8). Bottom: C. White DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.466 (n=37); D. Bane DRIVE->PNR -0.324 (n=70, t=-2.7). Most cells DIRECT [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-031", "score": 0.083, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-031 | Study family SF-APPA-031: Case studies: alignment with engine mix vs ORtg (+3.3 claim)\n- observed_research_question: Case studies: alignment with engine mix vs ORtg (+3.3 claim)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Games where the team mix was closest to the engine recommendation score more after strength adjustment.\n- observed_result: Closest vs most-deviated tercile +3.3 ORtg adjusted (raw +5.2); Spearman rho >0.4 in 62% of games. Cases: GSW-LAL rho 1.00 coachable +28.0 ORtg; MIA-BOS rho 0.80 aligned residual +27.9; NYK-LAL rho 0.80 coachable +25.0;  [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:BASE_RATE\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- observed_failure_evidence: No CI or test reported for +3.3; in-game PT ranking used as rho target shares outcome data; 3 of 6 cases are labeled honest counter-examples; every kernel rec is CUT-heavy.\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF32"}], "n_results": 4}

